WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.630
I think this was in the 80s,

2
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.120
if I remember correctly.

3
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:03.750
You had Fletcherism,

4
00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:06.640
which was a diet method

5
00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.350
where people were instructed to chew a bite

6
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.380
10 or 20 times before swallowing.

7
00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:13.600
And that worked,

8
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.760
but I don't know if you've ever tried,

9
00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.580
but if you chew one bite of food

10
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:18.740
for that many times,

11
00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.100
it becomes quite disgusting.

12
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.880
So I think it was also

13
00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.660
largely driven by palatability.

14
00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.440
And I think what's nice

15
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.620
about changing the texture of food

16
00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:29.100
is that people will alter

17
00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.800
their way of eating that food

18
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.060
naturally, without thinking about it,

19
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.360
and then naturally eat less of the food

20
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.060
compared to when they would eat it

21
00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:38.980
with little chews and very fast.

22
00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:41.020
Because there have been many efforts

23
00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:43.340
trying to reduce people's eating rate

24
00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:45.030
by more external factors.

25
00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:46.520
So in a research setting,

26
00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.240
we could have a screen

27
00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:50.340
that indicated when to take a bite,

28
00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:52.570
so there were longer breaks between bites.

29
00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:56.420
There are spoons that start to vibrate

30
00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:57.950
if you eat too fast.

31
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.020
There are all types of ways

32
00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:02.520
that people try to reduce people's eating rate.

33
00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.480
But I think the nice part

34
00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:05.780
about altering the texture

35
00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.940
is that it goes without thinking

36
00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.460
in a natural way.

37
00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:11.500
So you don't have to give people instructions

38
00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.210
or a special device.
